<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - Argentine May unemployment down to 16.1 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Argentine May unemployment down to 16.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Argentine Economy Ministry Friday announced the following labor market figures (expressed as percentages):</p>
<p>					   May '97    Oct '96  May '96</p>
<p>Unemployment				16.1	17.3    17.1</p>
<p>Underemployment			   13.2	13.6    12.6</p>
<p>Proportion of population employed   35.3	34.6    34.0</p>
<p>Labor force*				42.1	41.9    41.0</p>
<p>*Those employed or looking for work as a percentage of the entire population</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
